5. Execute the supported release procedure.
6. Receive device acknowledgment.
7. Update release status.
8. Preserve customer and registration history.
9. Preserve the consumed entitlement record.

Releasing a device must never restore its consumed entitlement.

Do not delete historical registration or audit information.

Do not alter Android Factory Reset Protection or unrelated device security settings.

