Android 9–15 must use the supported QR provisioning workflow.

Android 16 must use the supported USB/ADB BAT provisioning workflow, with all Android provisioning restrictions handled correctly.

The Android application must securely authenticate with the backend.

Remote lock and unlock must work through authenticated, signed commands.

The existing working Android locking mechanism must remain intact unless a verified technical issue requires a change.

The entire application must have a clean, professional UI, secure backend, normalized database, complete audit history and production-ready deployment architecture.

